SECTION 2 — COMPACT RAML FORMAT
============================================================

The compact RAML follows this general structure:

{
  "object(object description,required)": {
    "field(field description,required)": "datatype",
    "array(Not Present,Not Present)[array]": {
       "field(field description,required)": "datatype"
    }
  }
}

A leaf entry follows:

FIELD_NAME(DESCRIPTION,REQUIRED): DATATYPE

Example:

"transactionType(transactionType Id,true)": "string"

Interpret this as:

Actual RAML property name:
transactionType

RAML description/tag:
transactionType Id

Required:
true

Datatype:
string

IMPORTANT:
The actual RAML property name and RAML description/tag are DIFFERENT concepts.

This distinction is CRITICAL.

